# ─── Session scratch (CONVENTIONS.md §5, Planning — #94) ───
# Repo-local plan files a session writes at .claude/plans/issue-<N>.md — disposable,
# dies at code-ship teardown, never committed.
.claude/plans/

# ─── Worktrees / local Claude settings (#97) ───
# A directory here is a full untracked copy of the repo — colab's worktreeSubdir,
# historical (.claude/worktrees/) and default (.worktrees/, tools/colab worktreeSubdir()).
# Un-ignored, `git add -A` would commit a stale duplicate of the whole repo into itself.
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/
# Claude Code's local-override file — machine-specific absolute paths, not for VCS.
.claude/settings.local.json
